---
// Idea → first release → iteration, shown as the artefacts a founder actually receives.
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import estateos from "../../assets/work/estateos.png";
---

<ol class="journey" aria-label="From idea to shipped product">
  <li class="jf">
    <p class="jf-step mono"><span>01</span> Problem brief</p>
    <div class="jf-card doc">
      <p class="doc-title">Who is this for, and what must v1 prove?</p>
      <p class="doc-k mono">User</p>
      <p class="doc-v">Sales reps who log site visits on paper</p>
      <p class="doc-k mono">v1 proves</p>
      <p class="doc-v">Reps will log a visit from their phone, on site</p>
      <p class="doc-k mono">Not in v1</p>
      <p class="doc-v strike">Payroll · reports · offline sync</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <li class="jf">
    <p class="jf-step mono"><span>02</span> Clickable prototype</p>
    <div class="jf-card wire" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="w w--bar"></span>
      <span class="w w--h"></span>
      <span class="w w--row"><i></i><i></i></span>
      <span class="w w--field"></span>
      <span class="w w--field"></span>
      <span class="w w--btn"></span>
    </div>
  </li>
  <li class="jf jf--real">
    <p class="jf-step mono"><span>03</span> First release</p>
    <div class="jf-card shot-card">
      <Image src={estateos} alt="EstateOS tools page with stamp duty, EMI and visiting-card tools." widths={[360, 560, 720]} sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 380px, 45vw" />
    </div>
    <p class="label-real">Real first release · EstateOS</p>
  </li>
  <li class="jf">
    <p class="jf-step mono"><span>04</span> Releases after launch</p>
    <div class="jf-card log">
      <p class="mono"><b>v1.2.0</b> Export visits to CSV</p>
      <p class="mono"><b>v1.1.0</b> Manager approvals</p>
      <p class="mono"><b>v1.0.1</b> Fix duplicate submissions</p>
      <p class="mono"><b>v1.0.0</b> First release to the team</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ol>
<p class="jr-note"><span class="label-illustrative">Illustrative artefacts</span> Stages 1, 2 and 4 are examples of what you receive at each step; stage 3 is a real release we built.</p>

<style>
  .journey {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 560px) {
    .journey {
      gap: 18px 16px;
    }
  }
  .jf {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .jf-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--mute);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .jf-step span {
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }
  .jf-card {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3.3;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--panel);
    padding: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -28px rgba(10, 14, 20, 0.35);
  }
  .doc {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 2px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .doc-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 650;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .doc-k {
    color: var(--accent-text);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .doc-v {
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--mute);
  }
  .strike {
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }
  .wire {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 9px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 15px, var(--line-soft) 15px 16px), var(--panel);
  }
  .w {
    display: block;
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--faint);
    border-radius: 5px;
    height: 14px;
  }
  .w--bar {
    height: 10px;
    width: 40%;
  }
  .w--h {
    height: 22px;
    width: 80%;
    border-style: solid;
    background: var(--panel-2);
  }
  .w--row {
    border: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 46px;
  }
  .w--row i {
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--faint);
    border-radius: 5px;
  }
  .w--field {
    height: 26px;
  }
  .w--btn {
    width: 46%;
    height: 30px;
    border: 0;
    background: var(--signal);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .shot-card {
    padding: 0;
  }
  .shot-card :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: left top;
  }
  .log {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 10px;
    background: var(--ink-1);
    border-color: var(--ink-line);
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }
  .log b {
    color: var(--ok);
    font-weight: 500;
    display: block;
  }
  .jr-note {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 14px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--mute);
  }
</style>
